# The in-race pause menu and its screens (pak flow; w28r, written with script_probe --text).
# race_pak's front end (race from ~19.5 s), gas until 33 s; 36 START -> PLAYER 1 PAUSED (frame 1080: CONTINUE, OPTIONS,
# CONTROLS, AUDIO, VIDEO, RUMBLE PAK, RESTART, QUIT); OPTIONS (1201): RIGHT on every row; CONTROLS (2011: GAS ... RESET
# CONTROLS): LEFT/RIGHT on every row, A on RESET CONTROLS; AUDIO (2971) and VIDEO (3391) rows changed; RUMBLE PAK (3750:
# INSERT RUMBLE PAK NOW / NO RUMBLE PAK); RESTART (3960: the race restarts). Menu presses are 0.2 s (0.5 s auto-repeats).
# Reaches the pause CONTROLS screen (game_results_input, func_80100564, func_800D816C (Astra's), func_800D9058,
# func_800D8078), the OPTIONS screen code as options_menus, time_result_display, sound_loop_set, the rumble-pak screen
# func_8010BC84 and func_800D5A04 (restart); historical labels. (The pause AUDIO screen does not call game_results_update.)
